  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.2.0 adds positioned PNG/JPEG images on the vector canvas with five fit modes, clockwise text rotation, elliptical arcs and pie sectors, and native dash patterns with phase. It also fixes grayscale+alpha PNG decoding and text-matrix precision for small rotation angles. Full changelog: https://github.com/sahebansari/TerraPDF/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
